userdict/ESPrc/rectclip where{pop/rectclip load}
{{newpath 4 2 roll moveto 1 index 0 rlineto 0 exch rlineto
neg 0 rlineto closepath clip newpath}bind}ifelse put
% x y w h ESPrf - Fill a rectangle.
